   "source": [
    "## Q1\n",
    "\n",
    "### (1)\n",
    "\n",
    "As $\\hat{y}_j = \\frac{\\exp(o_j)}{\\sum_i \\exp(o_i)}$, we have\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "l(y, \\hat{y}) = - \\sum_j y_j o_j + \\log \\sum_i \\exp(o_i)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Thus, first derivative is:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac{\\partial l}{\\partial o_j} = -y_j + \\frac{\\exp(o_j)}{\\sum_i \\exp(o_i)} = \\hat{y_j} - y_j.\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  }
 ],
